OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud thickens during the early
OL,6,Fmorning, but breaks widely by the
OL,7,Fafternoon to leave sunny spells and
OL,8,Fdry conditions away from the coast.
OL,9,FLight winds. Temperatures just above
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with skies
OL,13,Fclearing overnight, winds become light
OL,14,Fand variable. Widespread mist and fog
OL,15,Fpatches develop by the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
